    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the thing is, it’s not just a \"break\" i need. a vacation or a week off isn't gonna fix the fact that i'm $50k in the hole and my career is basically a joke now. it feels like no matter how much i rest, the mountain just gets taller. it feels less like i need a break and more like i just need everything to finally, actually stop.",
