    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i get what you're saying about letting go of the pressure, but that just feels like a temporary bandaid. i'm talking about the fact that everything is just a cycle of misery. it's like, if i can't fix it, and i can't escape it, then the only real way to actually get some peace is for the whole thing to just end. does that even make sense? or am i just being dramatic?",
